# ALLOWLIST .gitignore — this repo is PUBLIC.
# Everything is ignored by default. Only files explicitly un-ignored below
# are ever published. Add new private files freely; they stay private.
*

!.gitignore
!index.html
!lessons/
!lessons/*.html
!reference/
!reference/*.html
!assets/
!assets/*.js
!publish.sh

# Deliberately NOT published (personal / identifying):
#   MISSION.md          — names the school, the class, the student
#   NOTES.md            — teaching notes about the learner
#   RESOURCES.md        — contains the teacher's email address
#   learning-records/   — assessments of the learner
#   README.md           — links to the private files above
